'''''Polygala monspeliaca''''' is a species of annual herb in the family [[Polygalaceae]]. They have a self-supporting growth form and simple leaves. Individuals can grow to 5&nbsp;cm.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Polygala monspeliaca L. - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/5494780|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Mifsud |first=Stephen |date=2002-08-23 |title=Polygala monspeliaca (Mediterranean Milkwort) : MaltaWildPlants.com - the online Flora of the Maltese Islands. |url=https://www.maltawildplants.com/PLGL/Polygala_monspeliaca.php |access-date=2022-03-07 |website=www.maltawildplants.com |language=en-us}}</ref>

